        },
        "content_FVVhQU": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are the clothes machine washable?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes — all our knitwear is designed to handle regular washing while staying soft and keeping its shape.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "content_Y3Vpma": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do the products last through hand-me-downs?",
            "answer": "<p>Absolutely. Our pieces are made with heirloom quality so they can be worn, washed, and passed down.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "content_JxjMnW": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where do you ship?",
            "answer": "<p>We ship worldwide, straight from our online store to your door.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "content_tEKyTz": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What makes Mika & Milo different?",
            "answer": "<p>Unlike fast fashion, our knitwear combines eco-friendly fabrics with award-winning design built to last.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "content_8ikKeD": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What if the size doesn’t fit?",
