    "index_faq_pEDhJ3": {
      "type": "index__faq",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_XkFKQc": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Section heading"
          }
        },
        "content_Xd9JJM": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why Organic Cotton?",
            "answer": "<p>At MIKA & MILO, we believe in saving the planet, one organic sweater at a time. We all know that cotton is <em>the  <\/em>best material use for our Little Ones. After all, it is natural, breathable and super easy to wash. However, did you know that you need a staggering 20,00 litres of water to produce just 1KG! That's pretty crazy right? That's why at MIKA & MILO we use GOTS certified organic cotton. It uses far less water, burns less CO2 and uses ZERO chemicals, make it a win for our Little Ones, the farmers who grow it and the planet which we all call home. Plus, we go one step further and add a dash of cashmere to the mix for extra softness. No wonder we've won BEST CHILDREN'S ECO BRAND at the Junior Design Awards 2023. <\/p>"
          }
        },
        "content_3VDqX9": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why Cashmere?",
            "answer": "<p>We add just a dash of cashmere for extra softness. After all, surely our Little Ones deserve only the best.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "content_TMHhrt": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why Do You Plant Trees?",
            "answer": "<p>We plants trees every month with the International Tree Foundation as our all wooded friends are not only majestically beautiful. They keep our planet nice and cool as they absorb a lot of that carbon dioxide which is raising temperatures across the globe. And that's why we plants lots and lots of trees every month. <\/p>"
          }
        },
        "heading_wtFNDR": {
          "type": "heading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Section heading"
          }
        },
        "content_rWhKbb": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why We Use Compost Bags?",
            "answer": "<p>We wrap all the products that we send out in recyclable tissue paper and then we pop them in a compostable bag so that you don't have to worry about they ending up in some poor whale's stomach. <\/p>"
          }
        },
        "content_aXVAmy": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How Many Awards Have You Won?",
            "answer": "<p>We have won 3 GOLD Junior Design Awards including the following:<\/p><p>Best Children's Eco Brand, 2023<\/p><p>Best Children's Fashion Brand, 2022<\/p><p>Best Children's Knitwear Brand, 2021<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "content_AYkxVQ": {
          "type": "content",
